 Illusion: High Electron Densities Create Extremely Metal-Poor Galaxy Impostors","authors":["Tiger Yu-Yang Hsiao","Danielle A. Berg","Steven L. Finkelstein","Ansh R. Gupta","Zorayda Martinez","Anthony J. Taylor","Hollis B. Akins","Oscar A. Chavez Ortiz","John Chisholm","Lukas J. Furtak","Vasily Kokorev"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该论文利用JWST/NIRSpec数据重新审视了四个看似极端贫金属星系（EMPGs），发现其中三个实际具有极高电子密度（10^5-10^6 cm^-3），高密度抑制了[OIII]λ5008谱线，导致传统低密度假设下金属丰度被低估约1.1 dex，真实验金属丰度实为12+log(O/H)~7.3-8.2。忽略高密度会导致星系被错误归类为贫金属星系。","date":"2026-08-21","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.20339","score":75,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]},{"id":"2608.20781","canonical_id":"2608.20781","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Pandora cluster Lensing, AGN, and Transient Exploration (PLATE) from JWST Multi-Epoch Imaging. I. Discovery of a type II supernova candidate in a spiral galaxy at $z=0.7$","authors":["Yuxuan Pang","Xin Wang","Ping Chen","Subo Dong","Hang Zhou","Shengzhe Wang","Qianqiao Zhou","Xunda Sun","Jifeng Liu","Hu Zhan","Karl Glazebrook","Ivo Labbé","Themiya Nanayakkara","David A. Coulter","Justin D. R. Pierel","Armin Rest","Jujia Zhang"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文报告了在Abell 2744场中发现的z~0.7瞬变源PLATE-23a，这是Pandora透镜、AGN和瞬变探索（PLATE）项目的首个成果。利用2022至2025年间多历元JWST NIRCam成像，在12个滤波器中探测到该源，通过差分成像分析其上升与下降阶段。宿主星系为z=0.688的棒旋星系，恒星质量约10^10.4太阳质量，恒星形成率约5.1太阳质量/年，位于恒星形成主序上。贝叶斯光变曲线分类强烈支持IIP型超新星起源。该源位于距星系中心约13 kpc（透镜校正后）的低局域恒星形成区域，暗示前身星可能从遥远的恒星形成团块迁移而来。黑体建模表明温度从约8010K降至6100K（爆炸后约65天），晚期SED与静止系一年左右进入放射性衰变阶段相符。","date":"2026-08-24","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.20781","score":62,"stars":3,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]},{"id":"2608.19162","canonical_id":"2608.19162","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Tracing gas outflows in molecular gas-rich galaxies with the SKA","authors":["Mamta Pandey-Pommier","Ramya Sethuram","Chiranjib Konar","Chinnathambi Muthumariappan","Subhashis Roy","Nirupam Roy","Alexandre Marcowith"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文探讨了SKA望远镜如何通过观测中性氢（H I）、分子谱线和射电连续谱，来量化活动星系核（AGN）射电喷流驱动的多相气体流出与反馈能量学，从而揭示射电喷流如何调节冷星际介质和恒星形成。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.19162","score":55,"stars":3,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"multi-phase gas","points":16},{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2608.19007","canonical_id":"2608.19007","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The progenitors of $z\\gtrsim10$ JWST galaxies in the COLIBRE simulations","authors":["Evgenii Chaikin","Andrew Pontzen","Carlos S. Frenk","Joop Schaye","Shengdong Lu","Robert A. Crain","Anna Durrant"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"本文使用COLIBRE星系形成模拟，研究了JWST在红移z≳10处发现的大量亮星系（M_UV≲-20），发现这些极端早期星系可以通过标准ΛCDM宇宙学和星系形成物理自然解释，无需对现有模型进行特殊调参。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.19007","score":55,"stars":3,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"high-z galaxy gas","points":20}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM","Galaxy Evolution"]},{"id":"2608.18897","canonical_id":"2608.18897","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"The efficient star-forming regions of stripped-envelope supernovae","authors":["M. Solar","M. J. Michałowski","J. Nadolny","L. Galbany","J. P. Anderson","J. Sollerman","T. Pessi","E. Zapartas","B. Šlaus","J. Alexander","O. Ryzhov","J. Hjorth","C. Jiménez-Palau","P. Nowaczyk","D. Somawanshi","A. Leśniewska"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.HE"],"summary":"该研究首次通过VLT/MUSE和ALMA观测，利用Hα/Hβ和CO(2-1)发射线分别追踪暖电离气体和冷分子气体，在云尺度（~100 pc）分辨率下计算富氢超新星（H-rich SNe）和剥离包层超新星（SESNe）位置的恒星形成效率（SFE），发现SESNe爆发环境的恒星形成效率比H-rich SNe高8倍。","date":"2026-08-20","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.18897","s